he upper-right corner. The Liquid Glass background of the button is yellow, and its label, which shows a checkmark, is white. The shade of yellow is vibrant.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/033f3f6540cc36385bc5993e2152895b/color-context-light-mode%402x.png","line":21,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the Notes app in iOS with the light system appearance and increased contrast. The Notes app is open to a note with the text 'Note'. The text is selected, which shows a yellow selection highlight and text editing menu. The Done button appears in the upper-right corner. The Liquid Glass background of the button is yellow, and its label, which shows a checkmark, is black. The shade of yellow is darker to provide more contrast and differentiation against the note's white background.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/9fa4e239f30421b0f00ee77dcace0c14/color-context-light-mode-high-contrast%402x.png","line":25,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the Notes app in iOS with the dark system appearance and default contrast. The Notes app is open to a note with the text 'Note'. The text is selected, which shows a yellow selection highlight and text editing menu. The Done button appears in the upper-right corner. The Liquid Glass background of the button is yellow, and its label, which shows a checkmark, is white.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/dc3523da3cba1dd53d3501c763335e6c/color-context-dark-mode%402x.png","line":29,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the Notes app in iOS with the dark system appearance and increased contrast. The Notes app is open to a note with the text 'Note'. The text is selected, which shows a yellow selection highlight and text editing menu. The Done button appears in the upper-right corner. The Liquid Glass background of the button is yellow, and its label, which shows a checkmark, is black.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/publishe